<title>FINLAND: OKO SAYS MYNTTINEN LEAVES FOR METSALIITTO.</title>
<headline>OKO SAYS MYNTTINEN LEAVES FOR METSALIITTO.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Osuuspankkien Keskuspankki Oy (OKOBANK) said in a statemenmt on Monday its board member Veli-Matti Mynttinen will resign from the bank on October 1 to join forest industry group Metsaliitto-Yhtyma as financing director.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
